<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
    <title>Event Welcome</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;background:#f3f7fb;font-family:Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif">
<table width="100%" bgcolor="#f3f7fb">
    <tr>
        <td align="center" style="padding:30px">
            <table width="720" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#fff;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #d9e2ec">
                <tr>
                    <td style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#6a11cb,#2575fc);padding:28px">
                        <table width="100%">
                            <tr>
                                <td>
                                    <h2 style="margin:0;color:#fff">🎉 Event Internet Service Welcome</h2>
                                    <div style="color:#eef4ff">TeleGlobal Communications Pvt. Ltd.</div>
                                </td>
                                <td align="right">
                                    <span style="background:#fff;color:#6a11cb;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:20px;font-weight:bold">EVENT LIVE</span>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td style="padding:35px;color:#555;line-height:1.8">
                        <p><b>Dear Sir,</b></p>
                        <p>Thank you for choosing <b>TeleGlobal Communications Pvt. Ltd.</b> as your Internet Service Provider. It is our pleasure to serve you.</p>
                        <p>We are pleased to inform you that your <b>{{ bandwidth }} Event Internet Leased Line</b> has been successfully installed, tested and commissioned. The service is now ready for use during your scheduled event.</p>
                        
                        <div style="background:#f5f0ff;border-left:5px solid #6a11cb;padding:16px;margin-bottom:20px;">
                            <b style="color:#6a11cb">Event Service Status</b><br>
                            ✔ Successfully Installed<br>
                            ✔ Tested Successfully<br>
                            ✔ Ready for Event Usage
                        </div>
                        
                        <h3 style="color:#2575fc;margin-top:25px;">Event Details</h3>
                        <table width="100%" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #ddd">
                            <tr style="background:#eef5ff">
                                <td width="30%"><b>Circuit ID</b></td>
                                <td>{{ circuit_id }}</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><b>Customer Name</b></td>
                                <td>{{ customer_name }}</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr style="background:#eef5ff">
                                <td><b>Bandwidth</b></td>
                                <td>{{ bandwidth }}</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><b>Event Duration</b></td>
                                <td>{{ event_date }}</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr style="background:#eef5ff">
                                <td><b>Usable IP</b></td>
                                <td>{{ usable_ip }}</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><b>Default Gateway</b></td>
                                <td>{{ gateway }}</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr style="background:#eef5ff">
                                <td><b>Subnet Mask</b></td>
                                <td>{{ subnet }}</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><b>DNS</b></td>
                                <td>103.68.9.253 / 103.68.9.252</td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                        
                        <p style="margin-top:20px;">Please find the testing logs and IP configuration attached for your reference.</p>
                        
                        <div style="background:#eefaf3;border-left:5px solid #198754;padding:16px;margin:20px 0;">
                            <b>24×7 NOC Support</b><br>
                            📧 noc@teleglobal.in<br>
                            ☎ 020-48522500<br>
                            📱 +91 8855811141
                        </div>
                        
                        <p>Our NOC team will continuously monitor your circuit throughout the event to ensure uninterrupted connectivity.</p>
                        <p>Best Regards,<br>
                        <b>{{ operator_name }}</b><br>
                        NOC Team<br>
                        TeleGlobal Communications Pvt. Ltd.</p>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td style="background:#2575fc;color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:14px;font-size:12px">
                        Thank you for choosing TeleGlobal Communications Pvt. Ltd. We wish you a successful event!
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
